// Post 9 figure (margin trading): SbP09AccountAnatomy
---
<figure class="sbp9-acc">
  <div class="scroll">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 900 330" role="img" aria-label="Three stacked bars for an account with 100M VND debt. Buying 200M of shares leaves equity 100M and ratio 50.0%. After a 10% fall shares are 180M, equity 80M, ratio 44.4%. After a 30% fall shares are 140M, equity 40M, ratio 28.6%.">
      <text x="20" y="28" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>The same 100M debt under three prices (VND, millions)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Cùng khoản nợ 100 triệu ở ba mức giá (triệu đồng)</tspan></text><rect x="70" y="180" width="130" height="90" class="fdebt"/><rect x="70" y="90" width="130" height="90" class="feq"/><text x="135" y="229" class="b" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Debt 100M</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Nợ 100 triệu</tspan></text><text x="135" y="139" class="b wh" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Equity 100M</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Vốn 100 triệu</tspan></text><text x="135" y="82" class="m" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Shares 200M</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Cổ phiếu 200 triệu</tspan></text><text x="135" y="292" class="b" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Buy: 200M of shares</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Mua: 200 triệu cổ phiếu</tspan></text><text x="135" y="312" class="ok" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Ratio 50.0%</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Tỷ lệ 50,0%</tspan></text><rect x="290" y="180" width="130" height="90" class="fdebt"/><rect x="290" y="108" width="130" height="72" class="feq"/><text x="355" y="229" class="b" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Debt 100M</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Nợ 100 triệu</tspan></text><text x="355" y="148" class="b wh" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Equity 80M</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Vốn 80 triệu</tspan></text><text x="355" y="100" class="m" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Shares 180M</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Cổ phiếu 180 triệu</tspan></text><text x="355" y="292" class="b" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Price −10%: 180M</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Giá −10%: 180 triệu</tspan></text><text x="355" y="312" class="ok" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Ratio 44.4%</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Tỷ lệ 44,4%</tspan></text><rect x="510" y="180" width="130" height="90" class="fdebt"/><rect x="510" y="144" width="130" height="36" class="feqr"/><text x="575" y="229" class="b" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Debt 100M</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Nợ 100 triệu</tspan></text><text x="575" y="166" class="b wh" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Equity 40M</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Vốn 40 triệu</tspan></text><text x="575" y="136" class="m" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Shares 140M</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Cổ phiếu 140 triệu</tspan></text><text x="575" y="292" class="b" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Price −30%: 140M</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Giá −30%: 140 triệu</tspan></text><text x="575" y="312" class="r" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Ratio 28.6%</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Tỷ lệ 28,6%</tspan></text><rect x="690" y="70" width="190" height="150" rx="10" class="box"/><text x="705" y="98" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>Ratio = (V − D) ÷ V</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Tỷ lệ = (V − D) ÷ V</tspan></text><text x="705" y="124" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>V = shares, D = debt</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>V = cổ phiếu, D = nợ</tspan></text>
      <text x="705" y="142" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>Debt stays at 100M.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Nợ giữ nguyên 100 triệu.</tspan></text>
      <text x="705" y="160" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>Equity takes every move:</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Vốn gánh mọi biến động:</tspan></text>
      <text x="705" y="178" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>−10% price = −20% equity</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Giá −10% = vốn −20%</tspan></text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Assumed account: 100M VND own money plus 100M borrowed buys 200M of shares. The debt is fixed, so the equity absorbs the whole price move.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Tài khoản giả định: 100 triệu tự có cộng 100 triệu vay mua 200 triệu cổ phiếu. Nợ cố định nên vốn gánh toàn bộ biến động giá.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

